<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>C-C++ on</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/c-c++/</link><description>Recent content in C-C++ on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Feb 2025 17:50:38 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/c-c++/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>pybind analyze</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/pybind-analyze/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 10:25:15 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/pybind-analyze/</guid><description>&lt;p>作用在于将 C++ 实现的函数封装为 module，供 python 代码调用。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>想要理解 pybind 的封装逻辑，还需要理解 python 是如何使用 pybind 生成的内容的，即关键点在于 python 的 import 机制的基本原理。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>C++ Class Inheritance</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-class-inheritance/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 17:53:07 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-class-inheritance/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="access-modifiers" class="heading-element">&lt;span>Access Modifiers&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#access-modifiers" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>&lt;code>public&lt;/code>: 成员可以被任意地方访问，包括类的外部&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>protected&lt;/code>: 成员可以被类本身及其子类访问&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>private&lt;/code>: 成员只能被类本身访问&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>We can use different modifier to modify super class and different modifier has different effect&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Polymorphism</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/polymorphism/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 11:54:10 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/polymorphism/</guid><description>&lt;p>谈及多态主要是在考虑具有继承关系的多个类型之间的关系。考虑多态的核心在于引用或指针的 &lt;strong>静态类型&lt;/strong> 与 &lt;strong>动态类型&lt;/strong> 是可能不同的&lt;/p>
&lt;p>静态多态 和 动态多态 的一个明显的区别是 &lt;strong>是 编译时 还是 运行时 解析调用&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>C C++ Const Keyword Unscramble</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c-c++-const-keyword-unscramble/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Feb 2024 09:09:43 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c-c++-const-keyword-unscramble/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="embellish-raw-pointer" class="heading-element">&lt;span>Embellish Raw Pointer&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#embellish-raw-pointer" class="heading-mark">
