 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>The first thing we need to do is understanding the correlations between multithreading and parallel computing.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>C++ Smart Pointer</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-smart-pointer/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2023 23:04:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/c-c++/c++-smart-pointer/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="原始指针" class="heading-element">&lt;span>原始指针&lt;/span>
